| !Run for Mupen64Plus (Nintendo 64 emulator) on RISC OS: the launcher on the icon bar.
| Drop an N64 ROM (.z64, .v64, .n64, or a zip of one) on its icon to play it in a desktop window.
| The emulator itself is started by the launcher through the Obey file Game.
| RISC OS port of Mupen64Plus. Copyright (C) 2026 David Sharp. GPL-2.0.
Set Mupen64Plus$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Mupen64Plus$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Mupen64Plus needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 Error Mupen64Plus needs ARMEABISupport 1.03 or later (from PackMan)

WimpSlot -min 2048K -max 2048K
Run <Mupen64Plus$Dir>.!RunImage %*0 2>/<Mupen64Plus$Dir>/launcherlog
